                    },
                    "name": "Consolidate All Data Fetch Of Collection"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1770021801131"
                  },
                  "code": "CONSOLIDATE_ALL_DATA_FETCH_OF_COLLECTION",
                  "id": "1762422721164",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1762422721165_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "From the output of {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.FETCH_JOB_SENIORITY_BUSINESS_OBJECT.$output}} extract the \"JobSeniority\" in the format of \"X Years, Y Months and Z Days\". \nIf the Job Seniority is Not Available, set it to null\n\nFrom the output of {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.FETCH_ENTERPRISE_SENIORITY_BUSINESS_OBJECT.$output}} extract the \"EnterpriseSeniority\" in the format of \"X Years, Y Months and Z Days\". \nIf the Enterprise Seniority is Not Available, set it to null\n\nFrom the output of {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.FETCH_PERFORMANCE.$output}} extract the \"PerformanceRating\" in the format of \"A/B\".\nIf the Performance Rating is Not Available, set it to null\n\nFrom the output of {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.FETCH_CURRENT_SALARY.$output}} extract \"SalaryAmount\", \"CurrencyCode\", \"SalaryBasisName\", \"SalaryBasisId\"\n\nAlso derive \n    CurrentSalaryAmountWithCurrencyCode = \"SalaryAmount\" + \" \" + \"CurrencyCode\",\n    CurrentSalaryAmountWithCurrencyCodeAndSalaryBasis = \"SalaryAmount\" + \" \" + \"CurrencyCode\" + \" \" + \"SalaryBasisName\"\n\nSet the output of {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.CALLINITIALIZEAGENTSREST.$output.result}} to the Variable \"ConfigurationObject\"\n\nSet the output of {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.PROCESSMANAGERNOTES.$output.result}} to the Variable \"ManagerNotesAndFeedback\"\n\nExtract the DisplayName, PersonNumber, CurrentBusinessTitle, AssignmentId, PersonId, WorkerType from the {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.$currentItem}}\n\nisPendingTxnPresent: {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.CONFLICT_DETECTION.$output.result.pendingTxnsPresent}}\n\nRequiredJobSeniority: {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.EXTRACTREQUIREDDATAFROMRAG.$output.RequiredJobSeniority}}\n\nRequiredEnterpriseSeniority: {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.EXTRACTREQUIREDDATAFROMRAG.$output.RequiredEnterpriseSeniority}}\n\nRequiredPerformanceRating: {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.EXTRACTREQUIREDDATAFROMRAG.$output.RequiredPerformanceRating}}\n\nGeneralRulesForPromotion: {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.EXTRACTREQUIREDDATAFROMRAG.$output.GeneralRulesForPromotion}}\n\nGeneralRulesForPromotionAreViolated: {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.EXTRACTREQUIREDDATAFROMRAG.$output.GeneralRulesForPromotionAreViolated}}\n\nSalaryHikePercent: {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.EXTRACTREQUIREDDATAFROMRAG.$output.SalaryHikePercent}}\n\nCurrentJobName: {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.EXTRACTREQUIREDDATAFROMRAG.$output.CurrentJobName}}\n\nProposedJobName: {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.EXTRACTREQUIREDDATAFROMRAG.$output.ProposedJobName}}\n\nFrom the output of {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.FETCHJOBIDFROMJOBNAME.$output.items[0].JobId}} extract the \"JobId\" and set it to \"ProposedJobId\".\n\nIsJobSenioritySatisfied: Compare the RequiredJobSeniority and JobSeniority to check if the jobSeniorityCriteria is satisfied. If yes, set the IsJobSenioritySatisfied to true. Else set it to false. If both RequiredJobSeniority and JobSeniority are Not Available or N/A set it to false.\n\nIsEnterpriseSenioritySatisfied: Compare the RequiredEnterpriseSeniority and EnterpriseSeniority to check if the enterpriseSeniorityCriteria is satisfied. If yes, set the IsEnterpriseSenioritySatisfied to true. Else set it to false. If both RequiredEnterpriseSeniority and EnterpriseSeniority are Not Available or N/A set it to false.\n\nIsPerformanceRatingSatisfied: From the RequiredPerformanceRating and PerformanceRating, compare and check if the performanceRatingCriteria is satisfied. If yes, set the IsPerformanceRatingSatisfied to true. Else set it to false. If both RequiredPerformanceRating and PerformanceRating are Not Available or N/A set it to false.\n\nProposedSalaryAmount: Salary Amount with SalaryHikePercent added.(Example: If salary is 100 and SalaryHikePercent is 5%, the ProposedSalaryAmount is 105)\n\nProposedSalaryAmountWithCurrencyCode = ProposedSalaryAmount + \" \" + CurrencyCode\n\nProposedSalaryAmountWithCurrencyCodeAndSalaryBasis (ProposedSalaryAmount + \" \" + CurrencyCode + \" \"+ SalaryBasisName )\n\nProposedBusinessTitle - Set it to ProposedJobName\n\nprofileCompletenessRanking: Initialize \"profileCompletenessRanking\" to 0 (total score = 100). Calculate the \"profileCompletenessRanking\" based on the following :\n    - If  \"IsJobSenioritySatisfied\", then add 100/3 to the profileCompletenessRanking.\n    - If  \"IsEnterpriseSenioritySatisfied\", then add 100/3 to the profileCompletenessRanking.\n    - If  \"IsPerformanceRatingSatisfied\", then add 100/3 to the profileCompletenessRanking.\n    - If  \"WorkerType\" is \"Pending worker\", then always set the profileCompletenessRanking to 0.\n    - Round to 2 decimals and cap at 100\n\nAdd the RequiredJobSeniority, RequiredPerformanceRating, DisplayName, PersonNumber, isPendingTxnPresent, CurrentBusinessTitle, ProposedBusinessTitle, JobSeniority, PerformanceRating, ProposedSalaryAmount, ProposedSalaryAmountWithCurrencyCode, ProposedSalaryAmountWithCurrencyCodeAndSalaryBasis, SalaryAmount, CurrencyCode, SalaryBasisName, CurrentSalaryAmountWithCurrencyCode, CurrentSalaryAmountWithCurrencyCodeAndSalaryBasis, SalaryBasisId, IsJobSenioritySatisfied, and IsPerformanceRatingSatisfied, CurrentJobName, ProposedJobName, SalaryHikePercent, GeneralRulesForPromotion, GeneralRulesForPromotionAreViolated, ConfigurationObject, ProposedJobId, RequiredEnterpriseSeniority, EnterpriseSeniority, IsEnterpriseSeniorityStisfied, ManagerNotesAndFeedback, profileCompletenessRanking, WorkerType fields to the output"
                    }
                  ],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"isPendingTxnPresent\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"WorkerType\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"profileCompletenessRanking\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"RequiredEnterpriseSeniority\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"GeneralRulesForPromotion\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"GeneralRulesForPromotionAreViolated\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"EnterpriseSeniority\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"SalaryHikePercent\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ConfigurationObject\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"AssignmentMap\": {\n                \"type\":  [\"object\", \"null\"]\n              },\n              \"ProfileOptionsMap\": {\n                \"type\":  [\"object\", \"null\"]\n              },\n              \"ActionOccurrenceMap\": {\n                \"type\":  [\"object\", \"null\"]\n              },\n              \"SeniorityMap\": {\n                \"type\":  [\"object\", \"null\"]\n              }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\n              \"AssignmentMap\",\n              \"ProfileOptionsMap\",\n              \"ActionOccurrenceMap\",\n              \"SeniorityMap\"\n            ]\n        },\n        \"ProposedBusinessTitle\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"CurrentSalaryAmountWithCurrencyCodeAndSalaryBasis\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"CurrentSalaryAmountWithCurrencyCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ProposedSalaryAmountWithCurrencyCodeAndSalaryBasis\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ProposedSalaryAmountWithCurrencyCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"SalaryBasisName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"CurrencyCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"RequiredJobSeniority\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"RequiredPerformanceRating\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ProposedJobName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ProposedJobId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"CurrentJobName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"IsPerformanceRatingSatisfied\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"IsJobSenioritySatisfied\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"IsEnterpriseSenioritySatisfied\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"SalaryAmount\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"PersonId\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"AssignmentId\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"SalaryBasisId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"DisplayName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"PersonNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"AssignmentNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"CurrentBusinessTitle\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"JobSeniority\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"PerformanceRating\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
                  "type": "LLM"
                },
