                  "code": "EXTRACTREQUIREDDATAFROMRAG",
                  "convergenceTargetId": "1762255194968",
                  "id": "1770017439236",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1770017439237_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "Promotion Criteria Document's Summary Text - {{$context.$nodes.PROMOTION_CRITERIA_DOCUMENT.$output.value}}\n\nCollective Agreement Document's Summary Text - {{$context.$nodes.COLLECTIVE_AGREEMENT_DOCUMENT.$output.value}}\n\nCurrentJobName - {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.$currentItem.JobName}} \n\nLegislationCode - {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.CALLINITIALIZEAGENTSREST.$output.result.AssignmentMap.LegislationCode}}\n\nIf the \"CurrentJobName\" is null, then set \"isProposedJobPresent\" = false, \"ProposedJobName\" = null, and \"SalaryHikePercent\" = null.\nElse if the \"CurrentJobName\" is non-null, then set the \"ProposedJobName\" and \"SalaryHikePercent\" from this Map - {{$context.$variables.jobProgressionArray}} \n\n\nExtract the following from the Promotion Criteria Document's Summary Text. The \"isProposedJobPresent\" and \"proposedJobName\" are the parameters for the extraction logic\n1. Extract and set the RequiredPerformancerating in the format of \"A/B\".\n2. Extract the RequiredJobSeniorityAsPerPromotionCriteriaDocument in the format of \"X Years, Y Months, and Z Days\".\n3. Extract and set the PerformanceDocumentName \n4. Extract and set the PerformanceReviewPeriod \n5. Extract and set the GeneralRulesForPromotion\n6. Set the CurrentJobName as the value from {{$context.$nodes.LOOPWORKERS.$currentItem.JobName}}\n7. Set the ProposedJobName\n8. Set the salaryHikePercent\n9. Also, from the \"proposedJobName\" and GeneralRulesForPromotion, understand if any rule is being violated. If yes, set the GeneralRulesForPromotionAreViolated flag to true.\n\nExtract the following from the Collective Agreement Document's Summary Text. The \"LegislationCode\" is the parameter for the extraction logic\n1. Extract the RequiredJobSeniorityAsPerCollectiveAgreementDocument in the format of \"X Years, Y Months, and Z Days\".\n2. Extract the RequiredEnterpriseSeniority in the format of \"X Years, Y Months, and Z Days\".\n\n\nFrom the RequiredJobSeniorityAsPerPromotionCriteriaDocument and RequiredJobSeniorityAsPerCollectiveAgreementDocument check which ever is higher and set the RequiredJobSeniority with the higher value"
                    }
                  ],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"RequiredEnterpriseSeniority\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"CurrentJobName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"GeneralRulesForPromotionAreViolated\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"SalaryHikePercent\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ProposedJobName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"GeneralRulesForPromotion\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"RequiredJobSeniority\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"RequiredPerformanceRating\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"PerformanceDocumentName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"PerformanceReviewPeriod\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
                  "type": "LLM"
